[size=6]Rejoin[/size]
🛟 [b]Need help or found a bug?[/b] Get support at [url=https://support.doodesch.de/rejoin]support.doodesch.de/rejoin[/url].

Adds a [b]Rejoin[/b] card to the main menu when a previous session is available. Flip it and select [b]Reconnect[/b] to return to your round.

The round keeps running if the host's game crashes. The host's main menu opens again, and guests can restart through Steam. Reconnecting restores your cards, turn and room changes. You choose whether to return.

[b]Early development state.[/b] Host crash and reconnect have local evidence from earlier versions. Version 0.1.3 fixes background-host mod loading, missing Neighbor choices and a crash when leaving a round. A reported remote-host Reconnect blackscreen remains unresolved. A full four-player test and a real AMD driver-crash test are still pending. Bugs may occur.

[size=5]Install[/size]
[list=1]
[*] Close the game and install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thecabingame/mods/4]UE4SS for the cabin game[/url].
[*] Copy [b]CabinRejoin[/b] and [b]CabinNativeProbe[/b] from the ZIP's [b]Mods[/b] folder into [b]the_cabin_game/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods[/b].
[*] Copy the ZIP's [b]the_cabin_game/Content/Paks[/b] files into the matching game folder. Keep each [b].pak[/b], [b].utoc[/b] and [b].ucas[/b] set together, with the same subfolders.
[*] Start the game normally through Steam.
[/list]
Install the same Rejoin version on every player's PC. Both mod folders and both container sets are required. UE4SS is installed separately.

Works with [b]Mod Settings[/b]: Rejoin stays on the far left, and Mods stays on the far right.

Supported version: Windows, Steam build [b]25553694[/b]. The background host now loads installed FastTurns, LobbyPets and ShortEvents with the host settings. FastTurns has local host/client evidence; full group compatibility remains unmeasured. Other mods that change the main menu or multiplayer may conflict.

The round ends when the host selects [b]Quit Game[/b] or hosts a new session. If the host's PC shuts down, restarts or the background session crashes, the round is lost. Rejoin does not save rounds for later or prevent driver crashes.

[size=5]Remove[/size]
Close the game and follow the removal steps in the included README. Keep shared UE4SS files if other mods use them.

[size=5]Help[/size]
Report your mod version, whether you hosted or joined, and what happened. The included README lists the log locations.

By [b]DooDesch[/b]. Uses UE4SS. Rejoin's license is included in the download.
